"""Type stubs for annoray's Rust extension module (`annoray._annoray`).

`Quantity` and `DataArray` are generic over a named dimension (`annoray.dims.Length`, …):
`Quantity[Length]` in annotations documents the dimension for type checkers, and
`annoray.dims.checked` enforces it at run time. Arithmetic results are `Quantity[Any]`:
Python's type system cannot compute dimensions (Rust's `Quantity<_D>` does).
"""

